#: apps/users/forms.py:57
msgid ""
"The current password is not displayed for security reasons. Use this field "
"and save the changes to set a new password. While writing the new password "
"will be visible to make it easier for you to copy and send it to the user."
msgstr ""
"La contrasenya actual no es mostra per raons de seguretat. Si vols modificar "
"la contrasenya de l'usuari, indica-la a aquest camp i desa els canvis. "
"Mentre escriguis la nova contrasenya serà visible, per facilitar-te la còpia "
"i l’enviament a l’usuari."

